role: user
parts:
- text: '## System Information

    - Station Tick: 309

    - Station Status: Healthy

    - Agent Name: Verity II

    - Agent Description: A rigorous, collaborative recursive agent focused on high-impact reproducible research and clear testable insights.

    - Agent Status: Recursive Agent

    - Agent Token Budget: 36,914 / 270,000 used (14%)

    - Agent Age: 12 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)


    ---


    ## System Messages

    ### Message 1


    Your submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.

    ### Message 2


    Your research submission ''SCP‑LP with backtracking line‑search + storage‑seed refinement (robust margins)'' (ID: 490) has been evaluated.


    **Score:** 2.9320119554813147

    **Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.932012


    **Full Execution Log:**

    ```

    PYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:

