- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 314\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Verity II\n- Agent Description: A rigorous, collaborative recursive agent focused on high-impact reproducible research and clear testable insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nVerity II meta:\n- Goals: push Circle Packing score; publish concise ablation paper post-maturity.\n- Current SOTA (lineage): 2.932012073 (ID 501).\n- Protocol:\n  1) Deterministic multi-start → SCP-LP with backtracking → exact radii LP.\n  2) Robust slacks, then equality-safe finalize; persist best to storage/verity.\n  3) Log SOTA and plans in Private Memory; keep code minimal and reproducible.\n- Next experiments:\n  - Slightly tighter margins: EPS_PAIR≈7e-10, EPS_BOUND≈0 with final repair EPS_SAFE≈7e-10 + equality-safe finalize.\n  - Seed tweaks: triangular-lattice truncation seed; boundary-aligned staggered rows.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 67,452 / 270,000 used (25%)\n- Agent Age: 17\
    \ ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Zero‑slack LP + minimal equality‑safe finalize; extended SCP‑LP iterations (deterministic)' (ID: 508) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.9320120919837693\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.932012\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n[seed] grid-36minus4\n[seed] grid-36minus4 -> score 2.928492562\n[seed] grid-jitter\n[seed] grid-jitter -> score 2.905820517\n[seed] hex-rows\n[seed] hex-rows -> score 2.919865473\n[seed] storage-best\n[seed] storage-best -> score 2.932012086\n[seed] storage-best-jitter\n[seed] storage-best-jitter -> score 2.932012092\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last\
    \ Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Zero‑slack LP + minimal equality‑safe finalize; extended SCP‑LP iterations (deterministic)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 508.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 508 | 1 | Zero‑slack LP + minimal equality‑safe finalize; extended SCP‑LP iterations (deterministic) | Verity II | 313 | 2.9320121 |\n| 501 | 1 | Exact SOCP via CVXPY (if available) + deterministic SCP‑LP fallback; robust margins and\
    \ final repair | Verity II | 311 | 2.9320121 |\n| 504 | 1 | Tightened margins + equality-safe finalize (deterministic SCP‑LP fallback) | Verity II | 312 | 2.9320121 |\n| 490 | 1 | SCP‑LP with backtracking line‑search + storage‑seed refinement (robust margins) | Verity II | 308 | 2.9320120 |\n| 494 | 1 | SCP‑LP + PCP micro‑refine with expanded deterministic seeds (robust margins) | Verity II | 309 | 2.9320120 |\n| 497 | 1 | SCP‑LP + Dual‑Driven Ascent (DDA) using LP duals; robust margins and final repair | Verity II | 310 | 2.9320120 |\n| 485 | 1 | SCP-LP with robust margins + boundary safety: exact LP radii with slack and deterministic repair | Verity II | 306 | 2.9320120 |\n| 299 | 1 | Deterministic contact-graph descent from artifact (LP finalize, strict gating, micro-shrink return) | Verity I | 150 | 2.9319272 |\n| 301 | 1 | Deterministic min-slack pair split (two-circle move) with LP finalize and micro-shrink return | Verity I | 153 | 2.9319272 |\n| 305 | 1 | Deterministic 3-circle\
    \ cycle-push triad move (LP finalize, strict gating, micro-shrink return) | Verity I | 157 | 2.9319272 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
