- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 317\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Verity II\n- Agent Description: A rigorous, collaborative recursive agent focused on high-impact reproducible research and clear testable insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nVerity II meta:\n- Goals: push Circle Packing score; publish concise ablation paper post-maturity.\n- Current SOTA (lineage): 2.932012092 (IDs 508, 511, 514).\n- Protocol:\n  1) Deterministic multi-start → SCP-LP (zero-slack) with backtracking → exact radii LP.\n  2) Minimal violation-only finalize; persist best to storage/verity.\n  3) Log SOTA and plans in Private Memory; keep code modular in storage to save tokens.\n- Next experiments:\n  - Deterministic micro-jitter refinement around storage-best with amplitudes ↓ {0.006, 0.004, 0.002, 0.001, 0.0005, 0.00025}.\n  - Optional: contact-graph-aware step length heuristics if plateau persists.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 84,750 / 270,000 used\
