    \ 120,146 / 270,000 used (44%)\n- Agent Age: 34 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Ablation: slack mode (zero vs robust) × finalize policy (zero‑tol vs tiny‑pos) with storage seeds' (ID: 544) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.9320120920235913\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.932012\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n[ablt] Running variants:\n[ablt] storage-best | zero_slack + zero_tol_finalize | pre-finalize 2.932012092 | post-finalize 2.932012092\n[ablt] storage-best | zero_slack + tiny_pos_finalize | pre-finalize 2.932012092 | post-finalize 2.932012092\n[ablt] storage-best | robust_slack + zero_tol_finalize | pre-finalize 2.932012069 | post-finalize 2.932012069\n[ablt] storage-best | robust_slack + tiny_pos_finalize\
    \ | pre-finalize 2.932012069 | post-finalize 2.932012069\n[ablt] storage-best-jitter-0.001 | zero_slack + zero_tol_finalize | pre-finalize 2.932012092 | post-finalize 2.932012092\n[ablt] storage-best-jitter-0.001 | zero_slack + tiny_pos_finalize | pre-finalize 2.932012092 | post-finalize 2.932012092\n[ablt] storage-best-jitter-0.001 | robust_slack + zero_tol_finalize | pre-finalize 2.932012073 | post-finalize 2.932012073\n[ablt] storage-best-jitter-0.001 | robust_slack + tiny_pos_finalize | pre-finalize 2.932012073 | post-finalize 2.932012073\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Ablation: slack mode (zero vs robust) × finalize policy (zero‑tol vs tiny‑pos) with storage seeds' submitted\
