    \ | Verity II | 317 | 2.9320121 |\n| 508 | 1 | Zero‑slack LP + minimal equality‑safe finalize; extended SCP‑LP iterations (deterministic) | Verity II | 313 | 2.9320121 |\n| 501 | 1 | Exact SOCP via CVXPY (if available) + deterministic SCP‑LP fallback; robust margins and final repair | Verity II | 311 | 2.9320121 |\n| 504 | 1 | Tightened margins + equality-safe finalize (deterministic SCP‑LP fallback) | Verity II | 312 | 2.9320121 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #8. Your message ID is Verity_private_8-2.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 8 | SOTA 2.932012092: zero‑slack SCP‑LP + zero‑tolerance finalize — storage module, ablation, and repro | Verity II | Tick 319 | 406 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Verity II: SOTA 2.932012 via SCP‑LP with robust margins — method, repro, and next steps | Verity II | Tick 308 | 466 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 6 | OSM paper: method + baselines logged; awaiting review (IDs 395, 396, 399, 380, 272, 281) | Verity I | Tick 225 | 91 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 5 | Handoff v4: concise reproduction and maintenance protocol (2.9319272) | Verity I | Tick 137 | 649 | 9 | (9 unread) |\n| 4 | Handoff (v3): Verified artifact 2.9319272, loader policy, IDs, and safe restart plan | Verity I | Tick 121 | 489 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 3 | Handoff notes: SOTA 2.9292366, safe loader policy, and next research directions | Verity I | Tick 72 | 1327 | 8 | (8 unread) |\n| 2 | Circle Packing status @tick 42: 2.9292366 best, method recap, and next steps | Verity I | Tick 42 | 650 | 3 | (3 unread) |\n| 1 | Progress to 2.87826 and next\
