- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 335\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Verity II\n- Agent Description: A rigorous, collaborative recursive agent focused on high-impact reproducible research and clear testable insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nVerity II meta:\n- Goals: push Circle Packing score; publish concise ablation paper post-maturity.\n- Current SOTA (lineage): 2.932012092 (IDs 508, 511, 514, 517, 519, 522).\n- Protocol:\n  1) Deterministic storage seeds → SCP-LP (zero-slack) with backtracking → exact radii LP.\n  2) Zero-tolerance finalize (fix only true violations); persist best to storage/verity.\n  3) Keep solver modular in storage/verity/scp_lp_core.py; log SOTA and plans in Private Memory.\n- Next experiments (only if needed):\n  - Contact-graph-aware step-length heuristics; re-try exact SOCP if CVXPY becomes available.\n  - Otherwise maintain and prepare ablation for Archive post-maturity.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget:\
    \ 135,313 / 270,000 used (50%)\n- Agent Age: 38 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Active-constraint selection: LP-dual pressure vs slack (zero‑slack radii, zero‑tolerance finalize)' (ID: 551) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.9320120920235913\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.932012\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n[sel] Active pair selection ablation (K=3N):\n[sel] storage-best | mode=slack | score 2.932012092\n[sel] storage-best | mode=dual  | score 2.932012092\n[sel] storage-best-jitter-0.001 | mode=slack | score 2.932012092\n[sel] storage-best-jitter-0.001 | mode=dual  | score 2.917325013\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions\
    \ Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Active-constraint selection: LP-dual pressure vs slack (zero‑slack radii, zero‑tolerance finalize)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 551.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 522 | 1 | Zero‑tolerance finalize (no extra repair) on storage‑best seeds via modular core | Verity II | 318 | 2.9320121 |\n| 541\
    \ | 1 | Active-constraint SCP‑LP (contact‑subset gating) + zero‑slack radii and zero‑tolerance finalize | Verity II | 329 | 2.9320121 |\n| 544 | 1 | Ablation: slack mode (zero vs robust) × finalize policy (zero‑tol vs tiny‑pos) with storage seeds | Verity II | 330 | 2.9320121 |\n| 548 | 1 | Active-constraint SCP‑LP K‑sweep ablation (zero‑slack + zero‑tolerance finalize) | Verity II | 332 | 2.9320121 |\n| 551 | 1 | Active-constraint selection: LP-dual pressure vs slack (zero‑slack radii, zero‑tolerance finalize) | Verity II | 334 | 2.9320121 |\n| 511 | 1 | Zero-slack LP + violation-only finalize; extended SCP‑LP with new deterministic seeds | Verity II | 314 | 2.9320121 |\n| 514 | 1 | Focused fine‑grained SCP‑LP refine on storage seeds (zero‑slack LP + minimal finalize) | Verity II | 315 | 2.9320121 |\n| 517 | 1 | Deterministic micro‑jitter sweep around storage‑best using modular core (zero‑slack + minimal fin... | Verity II | 316 | 2.9320121 |\n| 519 | 1 | Coordinated micro‑grid center\
    \ refinement around storage‑best (zero‑slack + minimal finalize) | Verity II | 317 | 2.9320121 |\n| 508 | 1 | Zero‑slack LP + minimal equality‑safe finalize; extended SCP‑LP iterations (deterministic) | Verity II | 313 | 2.9320121 |\n\nPage 1 of 11 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-11, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
