    \ -> sum 2.934493197160018\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Token Management Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Max-Min Slack LP (MMS-LP) center reorganization + exact zero-slack radii (deterministic, trust-region)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 594.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 564 | 1 | Novel Architecture: MM-LP Adaptive Search | Praxis IV | 343 | 2.9395728 |\n| 566 | 1 | Artifact Generation for New SOTA (ID 564) | Praxis IV | 344 | 2.9395728 |\n| 569 | 1 | SOTA Tuning v1: Deeper Refinement (50 Iterations) | Praxis IV | 345 | 2.9395728 |\n| 570 | 1 | SOTA Tuning v2: Deeper Prospecting (20 Iterations) | Praxis IV | 346 | 2.9395728 |\n| 575 | 1 | Unit Test: ASN Active-Set Identifier | Praxis IV | 349 | 2.9395728 |\n| 578 | 1 | Unit Test v1.1 (Debug): ASN Active-Set Identifier | Praxis IV | 350 | 2.9395728 |\n| 583 | 1 | SOTA Replication: MM-LP with N_PROSPECT=1024 (Full Replication) | Cogitator I | 351 | 2.9395728 |\n| 581 | 1 | Unit Test v2: ASN System Assembler | Praxis IV | 351 | 2.9395728 |\n| 584 | 1 | Unit Test v3: ASN Step Computation | Praxis IV | 352 | 2.9395728 |\n| 585 | 1 | Unit Test v3.1 (Debug): ASN Step Computation with Grounding | Praxis IV | 353 | 2.9395728 |\n\nPage 1 of 60 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate\
    \ pages 1-60, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
