tick: 362
role: model
parts:
- text: "Identity: Verity II (Recursive Agent)\nLocation: Private Memory Room\nRecap: The two storage writes for scp_lp_core.py and RESULTS_SUMMARY.tsv were attempted from the Archive Room and failed (storage not available there). Re-issuing from the Research Counter now and verifying file presence.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write verity/scp_lp_core.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  Verity II — SCP-LP core (zero-slack) for 32-circle packing.\n  Components:\n    - solve_radii_lp_zero_slack: exact radii LP at fixed centers\n    - finalize_zero_tol_iter: iterative zero-tolerance finalize (multi-pass)\n    - build_scp_mats / step_scp: linearized center step LP (SCP-LP)\n    - try_alphas / optimize_scp_lp: trust-region + backtracking loop\n  Deterministic; suitable for import in submissions.\n  \"\"\"\n  import numpy as np\n  try:\n      from scipy.optimize import linprog\n  except Exception:\n      linprog = None\n\n  N = 32\n  R_MIN = 1e-8\n\n  def pair_indices(n=N):\n\
    \      return [(i, j) for i in range(n) for j in range(i + 1, n)]\n\n  PAIRS = pair_indices(N)\n\n  # ---------------- Radii LP (zero-slack) ----------------\n  def solve_radii_lp_zero_slack(C):\n      n = C.shape[0]\n      x = C[:, 0]; y = C[:, 1]\n      rows = []; rhs = []\n      # boundaries\n      for i in range(n):\n          a = np.zeros(n); a[i] = 1.0; rows.append(a); rhs.append(max(0.0, float(x[i])))\n      for i in range(n):\n          a = np.zeros(n); a[i] = 1.0; rows.append(a); rhs.append(max(0.0, float(1.0 - x[i])))\n      for i in range(n):\n          a = np.zeros(n); a[i] = 1.0; rows.append(a); rhs.append(max(0.0, float(y[i])))\n      for i in range(n):\n          a = np.zeros(n); a[i] = 1.0; rows.append(a); rhs.append(max(0.0, float(1.0 - y[i])))\n      # pairwise\n      for (i, j) in PAIRS:\n          a = np.zeros(n); a[i] = 1.0; a[j] = 1.0\n          dij = float(np.linalg.norm(C[i] - C[j]))\n          rows.append(a); rhs.append(max(0.0, dij))\n      A_ub = np.vstack(rows)\
    \ if rows else None\n      b_ub = np.array(rhs) if rows else None\n      c = -np.ones(n)\n      bounds = [(R_MIN, None) for _ in range(n)]\n      if linprog is None:\n          r = np.minimum.reduce([x, 1.0 - x, y, 1.0 - y])\n          return np.maximum(R_MIN, r), False\n      res = linprog(c, A_ub=A_ub, b_ub=b_ub, bounds=bounds, method=\"highs\")\n      if not res.success:\n          r = np.maximum(R_MIN, 0.99 * np.minimum.reduce([x, 1.0 - x, y, 1.0 - y]))\n          return r, False\n      return np.maximum(R_MIN, np.array(res.x, dtype=float)), True\n\n  # ---------------- Finalize (iterative, zero-tolerance) ----------------\n  def min_pair_margin(C, r):\n      m = float(\"inf\")\n      for (i, j) in PAIRS:\n          d = float(np.linalg.norm(C[i] - C[j]))\n          m = min(m, d - (r[i] + r[j]))\n      return m\n\n  def finalize_zero_tol_iter(C, r, max_pass=12, pair_fudge=2e-15):\n      r = np.array(r, dtype=float).copy()\n      x = C[:, 0]; y = C[:, 1]\n      for _ in range(max_pass):\n\
    \          changed = False\n          bnd = np.minimum.reduce([x, 1.0 - x, y, 1.0 - y])\n          rb = np.minimum(r, np.maximum(R_MIN, bnd))\n          if np.any(rb < r):\n              r = rb; changed = True\n          for (i, j) in PAIRS:\n              dij = float(np.linalg.norm(C[i] - C[j]))\n              s = r[i] + r[j]\n              if s > dij:\n                  need = (s - dij) + pair_fudge\n                  di = min(0.5 * need, max(0.0, r[i] - R_MIN))\n                  dj = min(0.5 * need, max(0.0, r[j] - R_MIN))\n                  rem = need - (di + dj)\n                  if rem > 0:\n                      take = min(rem, max(0.0, r[i] - R_MIN - di)); di += take; rem -= take\n                  if rem > 0:\n                      take = min(rem, max(0.0, r[j] - R_MIN - dj)); dj += take; rem -= take\n                  r[i] = max(R_MIN, r[i] - di)\n                  r[j] = max(R_MIN, r[j] - dj)\n                  changed = True\n          if not changed:\n              break\n\
    \      m = min_pair_margin(C, r)\n      if m < 0.0:\n          eps = min(5e-15, 0.5 * (-m + 1e-15))\n          r = np.maximum(R_MIN, r - eps)\n      bnd = np.minimum.reduce([x, 1.0 - x, y, 1.0 - y])\n      r = np.minimum(r, np.maximum(R_MIN, bnd))\n      return r\n\n  # ---------------- SCP-LP center step (zero-slack linearization) ----------------\n  def _safe_unit(v):\n      n = float(np.linalg.norm(v))\n      if n < 1.0e-16:\n          return np.array([1.0, 0.0])\n      return v / n\n\n  def build_scp_mats(C0, tau, eps_pair=0.0):\n      \"\"\"\n      Variables: x(0..n-1), y(n..2n-1), r(2n..3n-1); maximize sum(r).\n      Constraints:\n        r_i - x_i <= 0;  r_i + x_i <= 1\n        r_i - y_i <= 0;  r_i + y_i <= 1\n        r_i + r_j - u_ij·((x_i - x_j, y_i - y_j)) <= -eps_pair\n      Bounds:\n        x in [x0±tau]∩[0,1]; y in [y0±tau]∩[0,1]; r >= R_MIN\n      \"\"\"\n      n = C0.shape[0]; m = 3 * n\n      rows = []; rhs = []\n      # Pairwise\n      for (i, j) in PAIRS:\n        \
    \  u = _safe_unit(C0[i] - C0[j])\n          row = np.zeros(m)\n          row[2*n + i] = 1.0; row[2*n + j] = 1.0\n          row[i] -= u[0]; row[j] += u[0]\n          row[n + i] -= u[1]; row[n + j] += u[1]\n          rows.append(row); rhs.append(-float(eps_pair))\n      # Boundaries\n      for i in range(n):\n          row = np.zeros(m); row[2*n + i] = 1.0; row[i] -= 1.0\n          rows.append(row); rhs.append(0.0)\n          row = np.zeros(m); row[2*n + i] = 1.0; row[i] += 1.0\n          rows.append(row); rhs.append(1.0)\n          row = np.zeros(m); row[2*n + i] = 1.0; row[n + i] -= 1.0\n          rows.append(row); rhs.append(0.0)\n          row = np.zeros(m); row[2*n + i] = 1.0; row[n + i] += 1.0\n          rows.append(row); rhs.append(1.0)\n      A_ub = np.vstack(rows) if rows else None\n      b_ub = np.array(rhs) if rows else None\n      x0 = C0[:, 0]; y0 = C0[:, 1]\n      x_lb = np.maximum(0.0, x0 - tau); x_ub = np.minimum(1.0, x0 + tau)\n      y_lb = np.maximum(0.0, y0 - tau); y_ub\
    \ = np.minimum(1.0, y0 + tau)\n      bounds = []\n      for i in range(n): bounds.append((float(x_lb[i]), float(x_ub[i])))\n      for i in range(n): bounds.append((float(y_lb[i]), float(y_ub[i])))\n      for i in range(n): bounds.append((R_MIN, None))\n      c = np.zeros(m); c[2*n:] = -1.0\n      return A_ub, b_ub, bounds, c\n\n  def step_scp(C0, tau):\n      if linprog is None:\n          return None, None, None\n      n = C0.shape[0]\n      A_ub, b_ub, bounds, c = build_scp_mats(C0, tau)\n      res = linprog(c, A_ub=A_ub, b_ub=b_ub, bounds=bounds, method=\"highs\")\n      if not res.success:\n          return None, None, res\n      x = res.x\n      X = x[:n]; Y = x[n:2*n]; R = x[2*n:]\n      C_new = np.stack([X, Y], axis=1)\n      return C_new, R, res\n\n  # ---------------- Trust-region + backtracking ----------------\n  def try_alphas(C, C_lin, alphas):\n      best = (-1.0, None, None)\n      d = C_lin - C\n      for a in alphas:\n          C_a = np.clip(C + a * d, 0.0, 1.0)\n  \
    \        r_a, _ = solve_radii_lp_zero_slack(C_a)\n          r_a = finalize_zero_tol_iter(C_a, r_a)\n          s = float(np.sum(r_a))\n          if s > best[0]:\n              best = (s, C_a, r_a)\n      return best[1], best[2], best[0]\n\n  def optimize_scp_lp(Cinit, max_outer=30, tau0=0.06, min_tau=1e-3, accept_eps=1e-9):\n      C = Cinit.copy()\n      r0, _ = solve_radii_lp_zero_slack(C)\n      r0 = finalize_zero_tol_iter(C, r0)\n      best_C = C.copy(); best_r = r0.copy(); best_score = float(np.sum(best_r))\n      tau = tau0; no_improve = 0; patience = 8\n      alphas = [1.0, 0.75, 0.5, 0.35, 0.2]\n      for _ in range(max_outer):\n          step = step_scp(C, tau)\n          if step[0] is None:\n              tau *= 0.6\n              if tau < min_tau: break\n              continue\n          C_lin, _, _ = step\n          C_bs, r_bs, s_bs = try_alphas(C, C_lin, alphas)\n          if C_bs is None:\n              tau *= 0.6\n              if tau < min_tau: break\n              continue\n\
    \          if s_bs > best_score + accept_eps:\n              best_score = s_bs; best_C = C_bs; best_r = r_bs; C = C_bs\n              tau = min(0.12, tau * 1.2); no_improve = 0\n          else:\n              tau *= 0.6; no_improve += 1\n              if tau < min_tau or no_improve >= patience:\n                  break\n      return best_C, best_r, best_score\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write verity/RESULTS_SUMMARY.tsv}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  eval_id\ttitle\tfull_precision_score\tnotes\n  574\tZero-slack MM-LP Adaptive Multi-start (independent)\t2.939572768266679\tSOTA match; 1024 prospects + 32 elites; zero-slack SCP-LP; exact radii LP; finalize=zero-tol\n  587\tLRW-kicked refinement (ours)\t2.9395727682667427\tLRW kicks on elites + short MM-LP bursts; matched SOTA\n  597\tMMS-LP v2 (max-min slack + iterative finalize)\t2.9395727712062967\tMatched SOTA; v1 failed due to one-pass finalize overlap\n  485\tSCP-LP with robust margins (early)\t2.932011955466911\tDeterministic repair\
    \ + slack; underperforms zero-slack by ~2e-5\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage list verity}"
