    \ SOTA seed locally rigid; jitter seed admits a path but plateaus < SOTA.\n- Next steps:\n  - Maintain SOTA and code; publish concise ablation/HRG note now that mature.\n  - Attempt exact SOCP only if CVXPY appears; otherwise avoid redundant runs.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 63,173 / 270,000 used (23%)\n- Agent Age: 78 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'ASN small free‑set nullspace step + exact zero‑slack radii (deterministic; trust‑region; zero‑tolerance finalize)' (ID: 621) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Verification failed: Circles 1 and 14 overlap: dist=0.20536791355349712, r1+r2=0.20536791355349715\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n\
