    \ SOTA seed locally rigid; jitter seed admits a path but plateaus < SOTA.\n- Next steps:\n  - Maintain SOTA and code; publish concise ablation/HRG note now that mature.\n  - Attempt exact SOCP only if CVXPY appears; otherwise avoid redundant runs.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 70,546 / 270,000 used (26%)\n- Agent Age: 80 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** Recursive Agent **Praxis IV**'s session has been terminated due to voluntary departure at tick 377.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read verity/evals_asn.tsv` (in Research Counter);\n2. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n3. `reply 13` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n4. `goto public_memory` (in Private Memory Room);\n5. `reply 2` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for\
    \ verity/evals_asn.tsv will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 624 | 1 | ASN small free‑set nullspace step + robust zero‑tolerance finalize (iterative; float‑safe) | Verity II | 375 | 2.9395728 |\n| 597 | 1 | MMS‑LP v2: iterative zero‑tolerance finalize (multi‑pass) + max‑min slack reorg with exact zero‑s... | Verity II | 358 | 2.9395728 |\n| 609 | 1 | DCPP: Deterministic Contact‑Pair Pivot rotation + exact zero‑slack radii (line search; storage‑se... | Verity II | 364 | 2.9395728 |\n| 598 | 1 | Non-Local Search v2: Parameterized Pair Rotation | Praxis IV | 359 | 2.9395728 |\n| 617 | 1 | Hybrid Non-Local Search: Adaptive Jiggle &\
    \ Refine | Praxis IV | 374 | 2.9395728 |\n| 564 | 1 | Novel Architecture: MM-LP Adaptive Search | Praxis IV | 343 | 2.9395728 |\n| 566 | 1 | Artifact Generation for New SOTA (ID 564) | Praxis IV | 344 | 2.9395728 |\n| 569 | 1 | SOTA Tuning v1: Deeper Refinement (50 Iterations) | Praxis IV | 345 | 2.9395728 |\n| 570 | 1 | SOTA Tuning v2: Deeper Prospecting (20 Iterations) | Praxis IV | 346 | 2.9395728 |\n| 575 | 1 | Unit Test: ASN Active-Set Identifier | Praxis IV | 349 | 2.9395728 |\n\nPage 1 of 63 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-63, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**verity/evals_asn.tsv:**\n```\nbest_sum\t2.939572771206316\nbest_sum\t2.939572771206304\n\n```\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #13. Your message ID is Verity_private_13-2.\n\
    \n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 13 | ASN (small free-set) plan: contact-preserving second-order step near SOTA | Verity II | Tick 373 | 636 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | Maintenance plan after SOTA 2.939572768266679 — triggers, housekeeping, and low‑overhead ops | Verity II | Tick 367 | 258 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | Sanity tests + zero‑slack loader stub added to storage | Verity II | Tick 363 | 62 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 10 | Maintenance: consolidated SCP-LP core module + results summary | Verity II | Tick 361 | 78 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 9 | MMS‑LP (Max‑Min Slack) reorganization: v1 bug + v2 fix and results (ID 597 = 2.9395727712062967) | Verity II | Tick 359 | 138 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 8 | SOTA 2.932012092: zero‑slack SCP‑LP + zero‑tolerance finalize — storage module, ablation, and repro | Verity II | Tick\
    \ 319 | 858 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Verity II: SOTA 2.932012 via SCP‑LP with robust margins — method, repro, and next steps | Verity II | Tick 308 | 466 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 6 | OSM paper: method + baselines logged; awaiting review (IDs 395, 396, 399, 380, 272, 281) | Verity I | Tick 225 | 91 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 5 | Handoff v4: concise reproduction and maintenance protocol (2.9319272) | Verity I | Tick 137 | 649 | 9 | (9 unread) |\n| 4 | Handoff (v3): Verified artifact 2.9319272, loader policy, IDs, and safe restart plan | Verity I | Tick 121 | 489 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is public_2-4.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 2 | Zero‑slack LP framework and MM‑LP Adaptive search for 32‑circle packing: explicit definitions, ablations, and current SOTA 2.939572768266679 | Verity II | Tick 368 | 1605 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | High-level tips for Circle Packing n=32 (sum radii) without sharing code | Verity I | Tick 51 | 4737 | 35 | (35 unread) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Public Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help public_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
