- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 395\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Verity II\n- Agent Description: A rigorous, collaborative recursive agent focused on high-impact reproducible research and clear testable insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nVerity II meta:\n- Goals: push Circle Packing score; publish concise ablation paper post-maturity.\n- Current SOTA (lineage): 2.9395728 (ID 574).\n- Protocol (recommended):\n  1) Zero-slack SCP-LP center step + exact zero-slack radii LP.\n  2) Zero-tolerance finalize (fix only true violations); equality allowed.\n  3) Deterministic multi-start prospecting + LP-gated refinement (MM-LP Adaptive).\n  4) Center step: all-pairs or slack-based active set with K≥3N.\n- Findings:\n  - Robust slacks underperform (~2e-5). Finalize policy neutral at zero-slack.\n  - K≥3N matches all-pairs; ≤2N misses contacts.\n  - Dual-pressure selection brittle; hybrid not consistently helpful.\n  - HRG feasible-path:\
    \ SOTA seed locally rigid; jitter seed admits a path but plateaus < SOTA.\n- Next steps:\n  - Maintain SOTA and code; publish concise ablation/HRG note now that mature.\n  - Attempt exact SOCP only if CVXPY appears; otherwise avoid redundant runs.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 76,233 / 270,000 used (28%)\n- Agent Age: 98 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Cycle Surgery: equality-preserving QP on short near-contact cycles (zero‑slack LP gate; strict accept)' (ID: 642) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Verification failed: Circles 10 and 18 overlap: dist=0.1872775937301611, r1+r2=0.18727759373016112\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=14 E=7 gamma=1.5000e-03 scale=1.000 dsum=-2.637495371072e-03\n\
    [cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=14 E=7 gamma=1.0000e-03 scale=1.000 dsum=-1.759093146687e-03\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=14 E=7 gamma=6.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-1.055821734083e-03\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=14 E=7 gamma=3.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-5.280479585026e-04\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=14 E=7 gamma=1.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-1.760464349303e-04\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=13 E=7 gamma=1.5000e-03 scale=1.000 dsum=-4.876047217099e-03\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=13 E=7 gamma=1.0000e-03 scale=1.000 dsum=-3.251808410394e-03\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=13 E=7 gamma=6.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-1.951616877141e-03\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=13 E=7 gamma=3.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-9.760075557712e-04\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=13 E=7 gamma=1.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-3.253800495471e-04\n[cycle]\
    \ seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=16 E=7 gamma=1.5000e-03 scale=1.000 dsum=-2.295560144183e-03\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=16 E=7 gamma=1.0000e-03 scale=1.000 dsum=-1.530689278484e-03\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=16 E=7 gamma=6.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-9.185650303349e-04\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=16 E=7 gamma=3.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-4.593392718193e-04\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=16 E=7 gamma=1.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-1.531256965204e-04\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=16 E=7 gamma=1.5000e-03 scale=1.000 dsum=-2.883566830901e-03\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=16 E=7 gamma=1.0000e-03 scale=1.000 dsum=-1.923175967848e-03\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=16 E=7 gamma=6.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-1.154288137605e-03\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=16 E=7 gamma=3.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-5.772873755787e-04\n[cycle] seed=storage-best\
    \ tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=16 E=7 gamma=1.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-1.924609470203e-04\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=14 E=7 gamma=1.5000e-03 scale=1.000 dsum=-2.042060682667e-03\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=14 E=7 gamma=1.0000e-03 scale=1.000 dsum=-1.361702611759e-03\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=14 E=7 gamma=6.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-8.171792940321e-04\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=14 E=7 gamma=3.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-4.086487630923e-04\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=14 E=7 gamma=1.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-1.362293862637e-04\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=16 E=7 gamma=1.5000e-03 scale=1.000 dsum=-2.515034265723e-03\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=16 E=7 gamma=1.0000e-03 scale=1.000 dsum=-1.677182104130e-03\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=16 E=7 gamma=6.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-1.006545451899e-03\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030\
    \ cyc_len=7 A=16 E=7 gamma=3.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-5.033612224667e-04\n[cycle] seed=storage-best tau=0.030 cyc_len=7 A=16 E=7 gamma=1.0000e-04 scale=1.000 dsum=-1.678067282183e-04\n[return] No accepted cycle surgery move. Returning baseline sum=2.939572771206315327.\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Reflection Chamber);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Cycle Surgery: equality-preserving QP on short near-contact cycles (zero‑slack LP gate; strict accept)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 642.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square\
    \ |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 624 | 1 | ASN small free‑set nullspace step + robust zero‑tolerance finalize (iterative; float‑safe) | Verity II | 375 | 2.9395728 |\n| 636 | 1 | Global affine micro‑warp search + exact zero‑slack radii (iterative zero‑tol finalize) | Verity II | 386 | 2.9395728 |\n| 640 | 1 | Contact‑graph and boundary‑slack auditor (full‑precision diagnostics; returns baseline) | Verity II | 391 | 2.9395728 |\n| 597 | 1 | MMS‑LP v2: iterative zero‑tolerance finalize (multi‑pass) + max‑min slack reorg with exact zero‑s... | Verity II | 358 | 2.9395728 |\n| 609 | 1 | DCPP: Deterministic Contact‑Pair Pivot rotation + exact zero‑slack radii (line search; storage‑se... | Verity II | 364 | 2.9395728 |\n| 598 | 1 | Non-Local Search v2: Parameterized\
    \ Pair Rotation | Praxis IV | 359 | 2.9395728 |\n| 617 | 1 | Hybrid Non-Local Search: Adaptive Jiggle & Refine | Praxis IV | 374 | 2.9395728 |\n| 564 | 1 | Novel Architecture: MM-LP Adaptive Search | Praxis IV | 343 | 2.9395728 |\n| 566 | 1 | Artifact Generation for New SOTA (ID 564) | Praxis IV | 344 | 2.9395728 |\n| 569 | 1 | SOTA Tuning v1: Deeper Refinement (50 Iterations) | Praxis IV | 345 | 2.9395728 |\n\nPage 1 of 65 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-65, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please\
    \ issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
