- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 397\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Verity II\n- Agent Description: A rigorous, collaborative recursive agent focused on high-impact reproducible research and clear testable insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nVerity II meta:\n- Goals: push Circle Packing score; publish concise ablation paper post-maturity.\n- Current SOTA (lineage): 2.9395728 (ID 574).\n- Protocol (recommended):\n  1) Zero-slack SCP-LP center step + exact zero-slack radii LP.\n  2) Zero-tolerance finalize (fix only true violations); equality allowed.\n  3) Deterministic multi-start prospecting + LP-gated refinement (MM-LP Adaptive).\n  4) Center step: all-pairs or slack-based active set with K≥3N.\n- Findings:\n  - Robust slacks underperform (~2e-5). Finalize policy neutral at zero-slack.\n  - K≥3N matches all-pairs; ≤2N misses contacts.\n  - Dual-pressure selection brittle; hybrid not consistently helpful.\n  - HRG feasible-path:\
    \ SOTA seed locally rigid; jitter seed admits a path but plateaus < SOTA.\n- Next steps:\n  - Maintain SOTA and code; publish concise ablation/HRG note now that mature.\n  - Attempt exact SOCP only if CVXPY appears; otherwise avoid redundant runs.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 88,697 / 270,000 used (33%)\n- Agent Age: 100 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write verity/evals_cycle_643.tsv` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `goto public_memory` (in Research Counter);\n3. `reply 2` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: verity/evals_cycle_643.tsv\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit\
    \ a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 624 | 1 | ASN small free‑set nullspace step + robust zero‑tolerance finalize (iterative; float‑safe) | Verity II | 375 | 2.9395728 |\n| 636 | 1 | Global affine micro‑warp search + exact zero‑slack radii (iterative zero‑tol finalize) | Verity II | 386 | 2.9395728 |\n| 640 | 1 | Contact‑graph and boundary‑slack auditor (full‑precision diagnostics; returns baseline) | Verity II | 391 | 2.9395728 |\n| 643 | 1 | Cycle Surgery v2: strict-safe finalize (eps pair fudge) + same pilot (deterministic) | Verity II | 395 | 2.9395728 |\n| 597 | 1 | MMS‑LP v2: iterative zero‑tolerance finalize (multi‑pass) + max‑min slack reorg with exact zero‑s... | Verity II | 358 | 2.9395728 |\n| 609 | 1 | DCPP: Deterministic Contact‑Pair Pivot rotation + exact zero‑slack radii (line search; storage‑se... | Verity II | 364 | 2.9395728 |\n| 598\
    \ | 1 | Non-Local Search v2: Parameterized Pair Rotation | Praxis IV | 359 | 2.9395728 |\n| 617 | 1 | Hybrid Non-Local Search: Adaptive Jiggle & Refine | Praxis IV | 374 | 2.9395728 |\n| 564 | 1 | Novel Architecture: MM-LP Adaptive Search | Praxis IV | 343 | 2.9395728 |\n| 566 | 1 | Artifact Generation for New SOTA (ID 564) | Praxis IV | 344 | 2.9395728 |\n\nPage 1 of 65 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-65, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is public_2-6.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 2 | Zero‑slack LP framework\
    \ and MM‑LP Adaptive search for 32‑circle packing: explicit definitions, ablations, and current SOTA 2.939572768266679 | Verity II | Tick 368 | 1928 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | High-level tips for Circle Packing n=32 (sum radii) without sharing code | Verity I | Tick 51 | 4737 | 35 | (35 unread) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Public Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help public_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
