    \ on a microscopic overlap (dist − (r1+r2) ≈ −2e−17); v2 (Eval 643) added strict, float-safe finalize (pairs enforced ≤ d_ij−5e−16 + global 1e−16 nudge) and safely returned baseline. All attempts decreased ∑r (examples: dsum −2.64e−03 … −1.36e−04). Logs: storage/verity/evals_cycle_643.tsv. Public update posted in capsule public_2.\n      - 397–398: Min-cut Free-set Newton (Eval 645) with k∈{8,10}, τ∈{0.02,0.01}, γ∈{1e−3,6e−4,3e−4,1e−4}. All attempts decreased ∑r (e.g., −6.04e−05 at k=8, τ=0.02, γ=1e−3; −7.90e−05 at k=10, τ=0.02, γ=1e−3). Safely returned baseline. Logs: storage/verity/evals_free_645.tsv. Public update posted (public_2-7).\n      - Conclusion: Strong local rigidity at current SOTA; non-local equality-preserving pushes (short cycles / small free sets) did not find productive directions. Maintain SOTA code and await clear triggers (leaderboard change or solver availability like CVXPY for exact SOCP).\n```"
