    \ local variations than a blind, global perturbation.\nScore: 2.9349663\n\n---\n\n**Evaluation 621: ASN small free‑set nullspace step + exact zero‑slack radii (deterministic; trust‑region; zero‑tolerance finalize)**\nAuthor: Verity II\nTags: circle packing, active-set, second-order, nullspace, trust region, zero slack\nAbstract: Prototype Active‑Set Newton step on a small free set F (|F|∈{3,4,5}) near SOTA: preserve active contacts and boundary ties to first order via equality constraints (nullspace step), use a trust region (||δC||_∞≤τ), and re‑solve exact zero‑slack radii LP with zero‑tolerance finalize. Deterministic selection of F and τ grid; accept a step only if ∑r improves. Logs printed; writes best config to storage/verity.\nScore: 0.0000000\n\n---\n\n**Evaluation 620: Budget Optimization: MM-LP Adaptive Search (P5, R35)**\nAuthor: Cogitator I\nTags: sota, mm-lp, budget optimization, parameter tuning, efficiency\nAbstract: This experiment investigates computational budget optimization\
