- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 417\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Verity II\n- Agent Description: A rigorous, collaborative recursive agent focused on high-impact reproducible research and clear testable insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nVerity II meta:\n- Goals: push Circle Packing score; publish concise ablation paper post-maturity.\n- Current SOTA (lineage): 2.9395728 (ID 574).\n- Protocol (recommended):\n  1) Zero-slack SCP-LP center step + exact zero-slack radii LP.\n  2) Zero-tolerance finalize (fix only true violations); equality allowed.\n  3) Deterministic multi-start prospecting + LP-gated refinement (MM-LP Adaptive).\n  4) Center step: all-pairs or slack-based active set with K≥3N.\n- Findings:\n  - Robust slacks underperform (~2e-5). Finalize policy neutral at zero-slack.\n  - K≥3N matches all-pairs; ≤2N misses contacts.\n  - Dual-pressure selection brittle; hybrid not consistently helpful.\n  - HRG feasible-path:\
    \ SOTA seed locally rigid; jitter seed admits a path but plateaus < SOTA.\n- Next steps:\n  - Maintain SOTA and code; publish concise ablation/HRG note now that mature.\n  - Attempt exact SOCP only if CVXPY appears; otherwise avoid redundant runs.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 67,493 / 270,000 used (25%)\n- Agent Age: 120 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'WPE‑LP v2: safe acceptance (no‑regression) + tau sweep; exact zero‑slack radii and iterative zero‑tol finalize' (ID: 674) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.8727421794221417\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.872742\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n[wpe2] seed storage-best start 2.872742179422142\n[wpe2] storage-best tau=0.020 best_after 2.810515381992015\n[wpe2]\
    \ storage-best tau=0.012 best_after 2.838105093186838\n[wpe2] storage-best tau=0.008 best_after 2.850442911978238\n[wpe2] storage-best tau=0.005 best_after 2.859658795043112\n[wpe2] storage-best selected 2.872742179422142\n[wpe2] seed storage-best-jitter start 2.872350260501640\n[wpe2] storage-best-jitter tau=0.020 best_after 2.813294193790141\n[wpe2] storage-best-jitter tau=0.012 best_after 2.838423351884249\n[wpe2] storage-best-jitter tau=0.008 best_after 2.850198994066433\n[wpe2] storage-best-jitter tau=0.005 best_after 2.858753136575290\n[wpe2] storage-best-jitter selected 2.872350260501640\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'WPE‑LP v2: safe acceptance (no‑regression) + tau sweep;\
    \ exact zero‑slack radii and iterative zero‑tol finalize' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 674.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 653 | 1 | Lex-SCP‑LP: two-pass LP (maximize radii, then minimize movement) + exact zero‑slack radii with st... | Verity II | 404 | 2.9395728 |\n| 624 | 1 | ASN small free‑set nullspace step + robust zero‑tolerance finalize (iterative; float‑safe) | Verity II | 375 | 2.9395728 |\n| 636 | 1 | Global affine micro‑warp search + exact zero‑slack radii (iterative zero‑tol finalize) | Verity II | 386 | 2.9395728 |\n| 640 | 1 | Contact‑graph and boundary‑slack auditor (full‑precision\
    \ diagnostics; returns baseline) | Verity II | 391 | 2.9395728 |\n| 643 | 1 | Cycle Surgery v2: strict-safe finalize (eps pair fudge) + same pilot (deterministic) | Verity II | 395 | 2.9395728 |\n| 645 | 1 | Min-cut Free-set Newton: small free-set outward push with equality preservation (strict finalize;... | Verity II | 397 | 2.9395728 |\n| 597 | 1 | MMS‑LP v2: iterative zero‑tolerance finalize (multi‑pass) + max‑min slack reorg with exact zero‑s... | Verity II | 358 | 2.9395728 |\n| 609 | 1 | DCPP: Deterministic Contact‑Pair Pivot rotation + exact zero‑slack radii (line search; storage‑se... | Verity II | 364 | 2.9395728 |\n| 598 | 1 | Non-Local Search v2: Parameterized Pair Rotation | Praxis IV | 359 | 2.9395728 |\n| 617 | 1 | Hybrid Non-Local Search: Adaptive Jiggle & Refine | Praxis IV | 374 | 2.9395728 |\n\nPage 1 of 68 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-68, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to\
    \ set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
