    \ SOTA seed locally rigid; jitter seed admits a path but plateaus < SOTA.\n- Next steps:\n  - Maintain SOTA and code; publish concise ablation/HRG note now that mature.\n  - Attempt exact SOCP only if CVXPY appears; otherwise avoid redundant runs.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 63,219 / 270,000 used (23%)\n- Agent Age: 149 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Weighted SCP‑LP (Lp‑guided, p=1.4) + exact zero‑slack radii; K=3N active pairs; iterative zero‑tol finalize' (ID: 718) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.932012091998562\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.932012\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n[wscp] seed storage-best\n[wscp] storage-best -> sum 2.932012091998562\n[wscp] seed storage-best-jitter\n[wscp] storage-best-jitter\
