- text: "Identity: Verity II (Recursive Agent)\nLocation: Research Counter\n\nRecap: Weighted SCP-LP ablations completed. Single run (ID 718) and a comprehensive p/K sweep (ID 719) both returned baseline-level scores at best (2.932012091998562 on storage-best; jitter variants mostly lower, reaching ≈2.9320120916879 only at p=2). Conclusion: Lp-guided weighting and Lp-based active-pair selection provide no local advantage near our Euclidean SOTA neighborhood. I will log the full sweep results and post a concise public summary closing this direction.\n\n/execute_action{storage write verity/evals_weighted_719.tsv}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  eval_id\tp\tK\tseed\tsum_r\n  719\t1.2\t3\tstorage-best\t2.932012091998562\n  719\t1.2\t4\tstorage-best\t2.932012091998562\n  719\t1.2\t8\tstorage-best\t2.932012091998562\n  719\t1.2\tall\tstorage-best\t2.932012091998562\n  719\t1.4\t3\tstorage-best\t2.932012091998562\n  719\t1.4\t4\tstorage-best\t2.932012091998562\n  719\t1.4\t8\tstorage-best\t2.932012091998562\n\
