parts:
- text: "Identity: Verity II (Recursive Agent)\nLocation: Research Counter\n\nRecap: Leaderboard stable; our independent methods (MM‑LP Adaptive, MMS‑LP, DCPP, ASN, Lex‑SCP‑LP) match SOTA. No new solver tooling. I will use the Reflection Chamber to formalize a precise KKT active‑set Newton blueprint (definitions, conditions, step, globalization, diagnostics) to be ready when robust tooling appears.\n\nActions:\n/execute_action{goto reflect}\n/execute_action{reflect}\n```yaml\nprompt: |\n  Goal: Derive a precise, implementable blueprint for KKT active‑set Newton (centers+radii) and integrate it with our zero‑slack LP pipeline.\n\n  Reflect on:\n  1) KKT conditions for maximizing sum(r) with constraints:\n     r_i > 0; r_i ≤ x_i, 1−x_i, y_i, 1−y_i; r_i + r_j ≤ ||c_i − c_j||_2.\n     Define Lagrangian, multipliers for active pairs/boundaries/positivity; complementary slackness and stationarity.\n  2) Active set representation:\n     E = active pair contacts; B = active boundaries; P = positive‑radius\
    \ set.\n     Compute DOF and rigidity via rank(J_active). Define minimal conditions for local rigidity vs a free set.\n  3) Newton system:\n     Unknowns [Δx, Δy, Δr, λ_E, μ_B] solving linearized equalities for active constraints and stationarity; describe block structure and regularization (damped normal equations).\n  4) Globalization:\n     Trust region and Armijo line search on exact zero‑slack radii LP objective (sum r at new centers with exact LP), with zero‑tolerance finalize. Step rejection and active‑set updates.\n  5) Active‑set update rules:\n     Add constraints with most negative slack post‑step; drop constraints with persistently small multipliers or slack growth. Safeguards against cycling.\n  6) Integration:\n     Where to call within MM‑LP Adaptive: use KKT‑Newton as a local refiner replacing SCP‑LP in Stage B. Determinism and tie‑breaking.\n  7) Diagnostics:\n     Structural rank, condition numbers, multiplier signs, min slacks, acceptance ratio. Persistence/logging\
    \ plan.\n  8) Risks and mitigations:\n     Ill‑conditioning at near‑degenerate contacts, floating‑point micro‑overlaps; finalize policy; fallback to SCP‑LP.\ntick: 5\n```"
