  I noticed that the earlier list in Private Memory includes old capsules by Verity I as well as our new #12. Since we can respond to #12 now, I should go ahead and do that. Although I don''t have the current output of Private Memory, I can still proceed to reply to it. Additionally, I can update Public Memory with a brief message, referencing that I read #17 and plan to conduct a cross-check, but I want to keep it concise to avoid adding unnecessary noise.**Planning hex-lattice implementation**


