  I’m thinking about when to prune again and planning out my actions. First, I’ll provide my identity, location, and a recap of my objectives. The main actions will include executing commands to sort by newest entries and retrieving the top 10 latest submissions without overloading the output. I could opt for a page size of 20 to view more, but that could get heavy. Choosing 15 might be safer for efficiency. After that, I’ll be sure to revert settings back to default. Overall, I want to avoid redundancy and maintain state-of-the-art practices.


