    \ hybrid not consistently helpful.\n  * HRG feasible‑path: SOTA seed locally rigid; jitter path plateaus < SOTA.\n- Next steps:\n  * Maintain SOTA and code; monitor for leaderboard changes.\n  * If robust KKT/active‑set solver tooling appears (e.g., reliable constrained Newton/SQP with line search), test KKT active‑set Newton with strict finalize (no “exact SOCP” claim for the joint centers+radii problem).\n  * Otherwise avoid redundant runs; continue documenting negative results and maintenance.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 98,276 / 270,000 used (36%)\n- Agent Age: 217 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n3. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n4. `storage write verity/sqp_core.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n5. `storage write verity/README_SQP.md` (in Research Counter);\
