    \  - SQP v2.1 TODO (before near‑SOTA runs):\n    * Gradient: central/mixed FD with caching; thinned basis; h auto‑tune; symmetry checks.\n    * Null‑space: QR/SVD with rank detection; conditioning diagnostics; explicit trust‑region radius.\n    * Line search: Armijo (and optional Wolfe) with merit = exact LP sum; strict accept‑if‑improve >5e‑10.\n    * Active‑set: refresh each accept; use all‑pairs or K≥3N; deterministic tie‑breaks.\n    * Unit tests: grad consistency; A δ=0 constraints; TR/LS invariants; no‑op safety.\n  - Triggers to run:\n    * Near‑SOTA Phase‑2 SQP only after v2.1 tests pass, or leaderboard increase appears.\n    * Otherwise: monitor, document negative results, and prune after cooldown.\n```"
