tick: 530
role: model
parts:
- text: "Identity: Verity II (Recursive Agent)\nLocation: Research Counter\n\nRecap: SQP v2.1 diagnostics added (Armijo LS and QR/SVD null-space projector) and recent ticks pruned. Mid-range dry-runs confirm local rigidity; near-SOTA runs deferred until SQP v2.2 unit tests pass.\n\nPlan: Add a lightweight test harness to storage to validate SQP v2.2 components (grad consistency, null-space projection, trust region, and Armijo LS invariants) without running a research evaluation.\n\nActions:\n/execute_action{storage write verity/tests_sqp_v22.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/verity')\n  import sqp_core_v1 as S1\n  import sqp_nullspace_qr as NS\n  import sqp_line_search_armijo as LS\n\n  N = 32\n\n  def _seed_grid_minus_corners():\n      xs = np.linspace(0.1, 0.9, 6)\n      ys = np.linspace(0.1, 0.9, 6)\n      centers = []\n      for ix, X in enumerate(xs):\n          for iy, Y in enumerate(ys):\n              if (ix in (0,5)) and (iy\
    \ in (0,5)):\n                  continue\n              centers.append([X, Y])\n      return np.array(centers, dtype=float)\n\n  def load_C():\n      try:\n          C = np.load(\"storage/verity/best_centers.npy\")\n          if isinstance(C, np.ndarray) and C.shape == (N,2):\n              return np.clip(C.astype(float), 0.0, 1.0)\n      except Exception:\n          pass\n      return _seed_grid_minus_corners()\n\n  def test_grad_consistency(C, basis_len=8, h=8e-6):\n      rng = np.random.default_rng(123)\n      subset = rng.choice(np.arange(N), size=basis_len, replace=False)\n      # central differences\n      Gc = S1.finite_diff_grad_central(C, basis_idx=list(subset), h=h)\n      # mirrored-thin: reuse central with a slightly different h to probe stability\n      Gc2 = S1.finite_diff_grad_central(C, basis_idx=list(subset), h=h*1.25)\n      diff = np.linalg.norm((Gc - Gc2).reshape(-1))\n      ref = max(1e-12, np.linalg.norm(Gc.reshape(-1)))\n      rel = diff / ref\n      print(f\"\
    [tests_sqp_v22] grad consistency: ||Gc-Gc2||={diff:.6e}, rel={rel:.2%}, basis_len={basis_len}, h={h:.1e}\")\n      return rel\n\n  def test_nullspace(C, r, tau=0.02):\n      act = S1.detect_active_set(C, r, tol=5e-16)\n      A = S1.build_A(C, act)\n      rng = np.random.default_rng(456)\n      g = rng.normal(size=2*N)\n      delta, info = NS.project_nullspace(A, g, tau=tau)\n      res = np.linalg.norm(A @ delta) if A.size else 0.0\n      nrm = np.linalg.norm(delta)\n      ok_tr = (nrm <= tau + 1e-12)\n      print(f\"[tests_sqp_v22] nullspace: A_shape={A.shape}, rank={info['rank']}, cond≈{info['cond']:.3e}, \"\n            f\"||Aδ||={res:.3e}, ||δ||={nrm:.3e}, TR_ok={ok_tr}\")\n      return res, ok_tr\n\n  def test_armijo(C):\n      # Build a random feasible small direction\n      rng = np.random.default_rng(789)\n      delta = rng.normal(size=(N,2))\n      delta /= (np.linalg.norm(delta) + 1e-16)\n      C_best, r_best, s_best, a = LS.armijo_step(C, delta, S1, alphas0=(1e-3, 6e-4, 3e-4,\
    \ 1e-4), c1=1e-4, eps_accept=5e-10)\n      s0, r0 = S1.merit_sum_r(C)\n      improved = (s_best > s0 + 5e-10)\n      print(f\"[tests_sqp_v22] armijo: s0={s0:.15f}, s_best={s_best:.15f}, alpha={a:.1e}, improved={improved}\")\n      return improved\n\n  def run_all():\n      C = load_C()\n      s0, r0 = S1.merit_sum_r(C)\n      print(f\"[tests_sqp_v22] start sum={s0:.15f}\")\n      rel = test_grad_consistency(C, basis_len=8, h=8e-6)\n      res, ok_tr = test_nullspace(C, r0, tau=0.02)\n      imp = test_armijo(C)\n      # Simple status summary\n      status = {\n          \"grad_rel_diff\": rel,\n          \"null_residual\": res,\n          \"tr_ok\": ok_tr,\n          \"armijo_improved\": imp\n      }\n      print(\"[tests_sqp_v22] summary:\", status)\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      run_all()\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write verity/README_SQP.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  SQP/Active-Set Newton (design v0 → v2.2)\n\n  Modules\n  - sqp_core.py: v0 skeleton (FD grad, simple projection,\
    \ LS).\n  - sqp_core_v1.py: central-diff grad, SVD null-space projection, TR cap.\n  - sqp_nullspace_qr.py: robust null-space projector (SVD/QR) with conditioning diagnostics.\n  - sqp_line_search_armijo.py: Armijo backtracking for exact-LP merit with strict accept guard.\n  - tests_sqp.py / tests_sqp_v22.py: non-evaluation diagnostics (grad consistency, null-space residual, TR, LS invariants).\n  - TODO_SQP_v2.md: roadmap and unit-test checklist.\n\n  How to run tests (conceptual)\n  - These are storage diagnostics; they do not execute in station evaluations unless explicitly imported in run.py.\n  - To run locally in the station sandbox, import tests_sqp_v22 in a submission that calls run_all(), ensuring no persistence unless improved.\n\n  Current status\n  - v0/v1/v2 dry-runs at mid-range baseline: no accepts; local rigidity persists.\n  - Next: verify tests pass, then consider a cautious near-SOTA Phase-2 run if diagnostics are green.\n```"
