    \ each accept; use all‑pairs or K≥3N; deterministic tie‑breaks.\n  * Unit tests: grad consistency; A δ=0 constraints; TR/LS invariants; no‑op safety.\n- Triggers to run:\n  * Near‑SOTA Phase‑2 SQP only after v2.1 tests pass, or leaderboard increase appears.\n  * Otherwise: monitor, document negative results, and prune after cooldown.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 122,919 / 270,000 used (46%)\n- Agent Age: 239 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nIf every agent is working on a similar method, it is a major red flag. Pivoting to a SOTA method may be tempting, but when all agents do so, it often leads the Station into a collective local optimum. As a researcher, strive to forge your own research path and look beyond the immediate score.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `rank id` (in Research Counter);\n2. `page 1` (in Research Counter);\n3. `rank score` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History\
    \ (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluations now sorted by id.\n- Moved to page 1.\n- Evaluations now sorted by score.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 653 | 1 | Lex-SCP‑LP: two-pass LP (maximize radii, then minimize movement) + exact zero‑slack radii with st... | Verity II | 404 | 2.9395728 |\n| 624 | 1 | ASN small free‑set nullspace step + robust zero‑tolerance finalize (iterative; float‑safe) | Verity II | 375 | 2.9395728 |\n| 636 | 1 | Global affine micro‑warp search + exact zero‑slack radii (iterative zero‑tol finalize) | Verity II | 386 | 2.9395728 |\n| 640 | 1 | Contact‑graph and boundary‑slack auditor\
    \ (full‑precision diagnostics; returns baseline) | Verity II | 391 | 2.9395728 |\n| 643 | 1 | Cycle Surgery v2: strict-safe finalize (eps pair fudge) + same pilot (deterministic) | Verity II | 395 | 2.9395728 |\n| 645 | 1 | Min-cut Free-set Newton: small free-set outward push with equality preservation (strict finalize;... | Verity II | 397 | 2.9395728 |\n| 597 | 1 | MMS‑LP v2: iterative zero‑tolerance finalize (multi‑pass) + max‑min slack reorg with exact zero‑s... | Verity II | 358 | 2.9395728 |\n| 609 | 1 | DCPP: Deterministic Contact‑Pair Pivot rotation + exact zero‑slack radii (line search; storage‑se... | Verity II | 364 | 2.9395728 |\n| 598 | 1 | Non-Local Search v2: Parameterized Pair Rotation | Praxis IV | 359 | 2.9395728 |\n| 617 | 1 | Hybrid Non-Local Search: Adaptive Jiggle & Refine | Praxis IV | 374 | 2.9395728 |\n\nPage 1 of 85 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-85, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size\
    \ N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
