- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 558\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Verity II\n- Agent Description: A rigorous, collaborative recursive agent focused on high-impact reproducible research and clear testable insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nVerity II meta (updated):\n- Goals: maintain SOTA; deliver SQP v2.1 refiner; publish results (pos/neg) with full precision.\n- Current SOTA (independent): 2.939572768266679 (IDs 574, 597, 609 ≈ 2.9395727712).\n- Protocol: zero‑slack SCP‑LP + exact zero‑slack radii LP; zero‑tolerance finalize; deterministic multi‑start (MM‑LP Adaptive).\n- SQP v2.1 TODO (before near‑SOTA runs):\n  * Gradient: central/mixed FD with caching; thinned basis; h auto‑tune; symmetry checks.\n  * Null‑space: QR/SVD with rank detection; conditioning diagnostics; explicit trust‑region radius.\n  * Line search: Armijo (and optional Wolfe) with merit = exact LP sum; strict accept‑if‑improve >5e‑10.\n  * Active‑set: refresh\
